uest and keep the claim moving toward the upcoming case‑management hearing.  \n\nAll other correspondence (adjuster report, restoration invoice, and the listed board/reinsurance items) can be filed and monitored, but no additional response is needed at this stage.", "response_hash": "sha256:f752141aecd9dacacc3b2899c6db006b6edc6e17aaffd6ffbab470c8a1fa0110", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
